# SPDX-License-Identifier: FSL-1.1-ALv2
#
# The image build context (Infrastructure Design §2; D-ID-OI-09): everything
# is excluded, then only what the Dockerfile copies is let back in. The last
# matching line wins. Secrets, git, dependencies, and build output never
# enter the context.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!tsconfig.build.json
!tools/package.json
!deploy/package.json
!contract/
!seams/
!packages/
!services/
!data/breached/top-1m.sha256-64.bin
!data/breached/MANIFEST.md

# Never, wherever they appear.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/test
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
deploy/local/.secrets
.git
